  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Run integration tests through the oha binary and simplify test setup by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/896\r\n* Train PGO with duration and request-count workloads by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/897\r\n* test: add VSOCK HTTP integration coverage in CI by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/899\r\n* Update deps by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/900\r\n* Reject invalid values for -p, -q and --burst-rate by @FalkWoldmann in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/901\r\n* Fix h3 latency correction by @FalkWoldmann in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/902\r\n* Fix HTTP/3 shutdown hangs in debug and fast modes by @Zaczero in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/903\r\n* docs: add Simplified Chinese README translation (README_zh.md) by @WanderLandWalker in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/904\r\n* docs: explain what --latency-correction does by @monsterlag in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/905\r\n* Show first byte stats in text output by @ZensykU2 in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/906\r\n* avoid macos-14 by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/908\r\n* Update deps by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/909\r\n* Collect results during rate-limited runs without a TUI by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/911\r\n* Reserve the Linux FD table before starting runtime workers by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/912\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @FalkWoldmann made their first contribution in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/901\r\n* @Zaczero made their first contribution in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/903\r\n* @WanderLandWalker made their first contribution in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/904\r\n* @monsterlag made their first contribution in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/905\r\n* @ZensykU2 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/906\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hatoo/oha/compare/v1.16.0...v1.17.0",
